{"3110370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dustwind: Resistance", "steam_appid": 3110370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3948210, 4544150], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dustwind: Resistance is a tactical single-player game set in a post-apocalyptic world, blending real-time combat with the ability to pause and plan. Lead a small squad against an invading army, make hard tactical decisions, and do whatever it takes to protect your people and your way of life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEAD THE RESISTANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/028c0c67b2b032dc29298f5ee6e110f8.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/028c0c67b2b032dc29298f5ee6e110f8.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/028c0c67b2b032dc29298f5ee6e110f8.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of Jake, his squad, and his loyal dog, Diesel. Reclaim your homeland and teach the raiders a final lesson. For freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PAUSE, PLAN, ACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/396a6c64c996fcb9f68aff1317733efa.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/396a6c64c996fcb9f68aff1317733efa.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/396a6c64c996fcb9f68aff1317733efa.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds in real time, but you can pause the game at any moment to issue orders, turning chaos into control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR TACTICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8b76b011f64953474cc7929cb968cbc6.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8b76b011f64953474cc7929cb968cbc6.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8b76b011f64953474cc7929cb968cbc6.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brute force, stealth, positioning, timing, aiming for body parts. How you fight is up to you. Choose wisely, because the enemy is no fool, and a single mistake can spell your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHAPE YOUR CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8cffce6e1b0aa85c909fb11366113fd4.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8cffce6e1b0aa85c909fb11366113fd4.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8cffce6e1b0aa85c909fb11366113fd4.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your squad with a revamped character system. Choose the best skills and gear to fit your preferred tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE EVERY TOOL OF WAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/2c2cb05936ef188a17844db295156464.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/2c2cb05936ef188a17844db295156464.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/2c2cb05936ef188a17844db295156464.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, chop, kick, or bite. Set traps, throw grenades, deploy turrets and barricades, or crush enemies with an armored car. So many ways to kill. So many ways to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR OWN BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/6daccfbef50383cd2bdad0c11ad94b05.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/6daccfbef50383cd2bdad0c11ad94b05.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/6daccfbef50383cd2bdad0c11ad94b05.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build custom maps and campaigns with the built-in map editor and share them directly to Steam Workshop to keep the fight going.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dustwind: Resistance is a tactical single-player game set in a post-apocalyptic world, blending real-time combat with the ability to pause and plan. Lead a small squad against an invading army, make hard tactical decisions, and do whatever it takes to protect your people and your way of life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEAD THE RESISTANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/028c0c67b2b032dc29298f5ee6e110f8.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/028c0c67b2b032dc29298f5ee6e110f8.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/028c0c67b2b032dc29298f5ee6e110f8.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of Jake, his squad, and his loyal dog, Diesel. Reclaim your homeland and teach the raiders a final lesson. For freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PAUSE, PLAN, ACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/396a6c64c996fcb9f68aff1317733efa.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/396a6c64c996fcb9f68aff1317733efa.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/396a6c64c996fcb9f68aff1317733efa.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds in real time, but you can pause the game at any moment to issue orders, turning chaos into control.</p><p class=\"bb_p